{"id":"mythe","lemma":"mythe","pos":"noun","rank":4324,"glosses":["myth (story)","myth (untruth), old wives' tale"],"ipa":"/mit/","audio":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/transcoded/f/fa/Fr-mythe.ogg/Fr-mythe.ogg.mp3","gender":"m","forms":{"plural":"mythes"},"examples":[{"text":"C'est un mythe.","en":"That's a myth.","words":[{"g":"it / that"},{"g":"is","l":"être"},{"g":"a"},null]},{"text":"Connaissez-vous quelques mythes grecs ?","en":"Do you know any Greek myths?","words":[{"g":"to know","l":"connaître"},{"g":"you"},{"g":"some","l":"quelque"},null,{"g":"Ancient Greek","l":"grec"}]},{"text":"Il s'agit d'un mythe.","en":"That's a myth.","words":[{"g":"he / it"},{"g":"oneself / if"},{"g":"to act, to do","l":"agir"},{"g":"of / from"},{"g":"a"},null]},{"text":"Il a écrit une nouvelle basée sur un mythe.","en":"He wrote a novel based on ancient myths.","words":[{"g":"he / it"},{"g":"has","l":"avoir"},{"g":"to write","l":"écrire"},{"g":"a"},{"g":"news"},{"g":"based","l":"basé"},{"g":"on"},{"g":"a"},null]},{"text":"Que les pauvres gens soient paresseux est un mythe.","en":"It's a myth that poor people are lazy.","words":[{"g":"that / what"},{"g":"the / them","l":"le"},{"g":"poor","l":"pauvre"},{"g":"people"},{"g":"to be","l":"être"},{"g":"lazy"},{"g":"is","l":"être"},{"g":"a"},null]}]}